      "stem": "Make $x$ the subject of $y = 3x + 5$.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "$x = 3y - 5$"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$x = \\frac{y - 5}{3}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "$x = \\frac{3}{y - 5}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$x = \\frac{y + 5}{3}$"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "Subtract $5$ from both sides: $y - 5 = 3x$. Divide by $3$: $x = \\frac{y - 5}{3}$."
